ng needed, let me use a Workflow to parallelize the searches across the 4 directories for each chain node. Actually, let me think about this more carefully. The skill says I should search systematically with Level A → B → C. Let me start with the most important keywords.\n\nLet me do the searches in parallel batches. First batch: Level A queries for S1-S7 across all 4 directories.\n\nActually, looking at the instruction again, I should do the semantic segmentation first, then systematically search. Let me organize this properly.\n\nLet me start the searches. I'll batch them logically.","signature":"5e7ad244-619c-4033-b6b4-147132a6e8a0"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":27829,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":19968,"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"6c5e516e-2581-4163-a224-dfd6ebbac74a","uuid":"fa2e108a-61a3-4863-b1bf-0b18a03786cd"}
