es":[{"match":"Ascend","offset":2127}],"excerpt":"- EPD-Serve A Flexible Multimodal EPD Disaggregation Inference Serving System On Ascend"},{"filename":"knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Dynamic Sparse Index Building (动态稀疏索引构建).md","basename":"Dynamic Sparse Index Building (动态稀疏索引构建)","score":16.122941726728016,"foundWords":["ascending;","ascending"],"matches":[{"match":"ascending;","offset":689}],"excerpt":"Sort i_v ascending; Sort i_s descending\n    # 找到第一条穿过当前行 i 的斜线\n    j_s = biset_left(i_s, i × B)       # 二分查找\n    # 计算斜线在当前行的范围\n    r_start = (i-1) × B - i_s[j_s]\n    r_end = i × B - i_s[j_s]\n    # Point-range two-way merge\n    j_v = 1\n    blocks_i = []; columns_i = []\n    while j_s ≤ k_s:\n        if j_v ≤…"},{"filename":"knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/GroupGEMM (Grouped GEMM for MoE).md","basename":"GroupGEMM (Grouped GEMM for MoE)","score":15.059002443981312,"foundWords":["ascending=true","ascending"],"matches":[{"match":"ascending=True","offset":1187}],"excerpt":"ascending=True\n)\nfor tile in tiles_sorted:\n    GEMM_tile(tile)\n```\n在 Hopper 架构上，CUTLASS GroupGEMM 内部使用 TMA (cp.async.bulk) 指令实现异步 global→shared memory 数据传输，producer warp 发起 TMA 请求后 consumer warp 在 tensor core 上执行 MMA，形成软件流水线。Comet 保持此流水线不变，仅在 tile 调度层面注入重排序逻辑。\n术语一般如何实现？如何使用？\n- CUTLASS 3.x 提供 `cutl…"},{"filename":"knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/INT8 Trainable Attention (SageBwd).md","basename":"INT8 Trainable Attention (SageBwd)","score":14.592489518335878,"foundWords":["ascend"],"matches":[{"match":"Ascend","offset":568}],"excerpt":"…per-block 量化。选择 INT8 而非 FP8 作为训练量化精度，因 INT8 反向梯度精度更高（CosSim 0.9987 vs FP8 0.9880）且硬件支持更广泛（A100/AMD/Ascend 均支持 INT8 Tensor Core）。\n从算法pipeline角度拆解术语，比如术语所在pipeline的伪代码或具体计算过程，给出具体例子。通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。\n前向（Algorithm 2 简化）：\n```\n输入: Q, K, V ∈ FP16\ns_Q, Q̂_i = ψ(Q_i)   // per-block INT8: s_X = max(|X|)/127\ns_K, K̂_j = ψ(K_j^T)\ns_V, V̂_j = ψ(V_j)\nK_m = mean(K); K ← K - K_m  // Smoothing K\n// QK^T matmul…"},{"filename":"knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/CPU Chunked Attention Verification Kernel（CPU 分块注意力验证 Kernel）.md","basename":"CPU Chunked Attention Verification Kernel（CPU 分块注意力验证 Kernel）","score":14.128843367852399,"foundWords":["ascend"],"matches":[{"match":"-ascen","offset":2457}],"excerpt":"BigMac 从算法/模型结构层面直接减少 All-to-All 通信量——通过 DCCA（descend-communicate-communicate-ascend）策略将 All-to-All 通信从 full hidden dimension h 移至压缩后的低维 r·h。通信量公式：$C_{BigMac} = 2 \\times top\\_k \\times \\frac{ep-1}{ep} \\times b \\times s \\times (r \\cdot h) = r \\times C_{baseline}$。当 r=0.25 时，通信量减少 75%（如 GPT3-XL + 64 experts + ep=32: 1,488 GB → 372 GB）。该方法仅改变模型结构（projection 顺序 + expert 内部结构），不修改…"},{"filename":"knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Lagrangian Constraint Training for Sparsity (拉格朗日约束稀疏训练).md","basename":"Lagrangian Constraint Training for Sparsity (拉格朗日约束稀疏训练)","score":11.286883846013698,"foundWords":["ascent"],"matches":[{"match":"ascent","offset":200}],"excerpt":"…for Sparsity 是一种通过可训练 Lagrange 乘子（λ1, λ2）在 min-max 框架下自动平衡语言建模损失与稀疏度约束的训练方法。与固定惩罚系数不同，λ 通过 gradient ascent 动态调整，使不同任务能容忍不同的 sparsity-vs-performance gap。Elastic Attention（Tang et al., 2025）和 PruLong（Bhaskar et al., 2025）均采用此方法。\n从算法pipeline角度拆解术语。\n```\n# 训练目标（Elastic Attention）\n# 外层: max_{λ1, λ2}, 内层: min_{router params}\nΩ_MSR = (1/(L·H)) · Σ_l Σ_h I[r_hard[l,h] == SA]\nL_diff = Ω_MSR - t        # t…"},{"filename":"knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Hard Concrete Distribution _ L0 Regularization for Pruning.md","basename":"Hard Concrete Distribution _ L0 Regularization for Pruning","score":11.267313932038245,"foundWords":["ascent"],"matches":[{"match":"nt asc","offset":702}],"excerpt":"// Lagrangian: L_reg = λ1(s - t) + λ2(s - t)²，λ1,λ2 gradient ascent\n// 最终：max_{λ1,λ2} min_{log_α} E[NTP_loss] + L_reg\n```\n术语一般如何实现？如何使用？\nPruLong 训练：1000 steps, 1M token batch, seq_len 131K, LR=1.0 for log_α/λ, sparsity warmup 0→t over 800 steps, 不更新 model weights。训练后取 top k% log_α = +∞ (z=1), 其余 -∞ (z=0)。原始：https://github.com/AMLab-Amsterdam/L0_regulari…"},{"filename":"knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Expert Recommendation in Federated Learning.md","basename":"Expert Recommendation in Federated Learning","score":7.148988829701883,"foundWords":["ascending"],"matches":[{"match":"hat ascen","offset":1115}],"excerpt":"remove top_|n| experts sorted by p_hat ascending\n        if adjusted model worse:\n            revert and fix structure\n```\nExpert Recommendation 利用群体智慧指导个体结构调整，是一种\"试探-验证-回退\"的安全机制。\n涉及论文标题：\n- FedMoE Personalized Federated Learning via Heterogeneous Mixture of Experts"},{"filename":"knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Video Scene Segmentation via Inter-Frame Similarity.md","basename":"Video Scene Segmentation via Inter-Frame Similarity","score":7.094236355108205,"foundWords":["ascending"],"matches":[{"match":"ascending","offset":705}],"excerpt":"sims.sort(key=lambda x: x[1])                        # ascending similarity\nsplit_idx = sorted([s[0] for s in sims[:S-1]])       # S-1 lowest-sim boundaries\nscenes = []\nprev = 0\nfor idx in split_idx:\n    scenes.append(frames[prev:idx+1])\n    prev = idx + 1\nscenes.append(frames[prev:])                          # last scene\n```\nDINOv2 特征对光照/视角鲁棒、对内容变化敏感。…"}],"totalCount":50,"truncated":true},"effectiveQuery":"path:knowledge_notes Ascend"}}}
