sor\",\"offset\":1087},{\"match\":\"smem_addr,\",\"offset\":1158},{\"match\":\"tensor\",\"offset\":1223},{\"match\":\"tensor\",\"offset\":1272},{\"match\":\"SM\",\"offset\":1501},{\"match\":\"Tensor\",\"offset\":1677},{\"match\":\"Cores\",\"offset\":1684},{\"match\":\"small\",\"offset\":1764},{\"match\":\"FP8\",\"offset\":1789},{\"match\":\"H100\",\"offset\":1898},{\"match\":\"tensor\",\"offset\":2002},{\"match\":\"tensor\",\"offset\":2372},{\"match\":\"tensor\",\"offset\":2401},{\"match\":\"H100\",\"offset\":2448},{\"match\":\"Core\",\"offset\":2770}],\"excerpt\":\"## Tensor Memory Accelerator (TMA / 张量内存加速器)\\n术语是什么？通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。\\nTensor Memory Accelerator (TMA) 是 NVIDIA Hopper (H100) GPU 架构引入的专用硬件拷贝引擎，用于在 global memory (HBM) 和 shared memory (SRAM) 之间进行高效的异步批量数据传输。TMA 支持 1D 到 5D tensor 的双向传输，核心特性包括：(1) 单线程发起——整个 warp 中只需一个线程发出 TMA transfer 指令，其余线程可继续计算；(2) 无寄存器…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/硬件知识笔记/WGMMA (Warpgroup Matrix Multiply-Accumulate) on Hopper GPU.md\",\"basename\":\"WGMMA (Warpgroup Matrix Multiply-Accumulate) on Hopper GPU\",\"score\":739.9630424511139,\"foundWords\":[\"nvidia\",\"h100\",\"h100,\",\"h100）；\",\"smem。\",\"smem,\",\"smem\",\"sm90\",\"tensor\",\"tensorized\",\"tensor-vector\",\"core\",\"fp8\",\"fp8——fp8\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"NVIDIA\",\"offset\":154},{\"match\":\"H100,\",\"offset\":172},{\"match\":\"SM90\",\"offset\":178},{\"match\":\"Tensor\",\"offset\":192},{\"match\":\"Core\",\"offset\":199},{\"match\":\"Tensor\",\"offset\":400},{\"match\":\"Core\",\"offset\":407},{\"match\":\"FP8\",\"offset\":520},{\"match\":\"FP8\",\"offset\":535},{\"match\":\"Tensor\",\"offset\":539},{\"match\":\"Core\",\"offset\":546},{\"match\":\"FP8\",\"offset\":583},{\"match\":\"H100）；\",\"offset\":609},{\"match\":\"FP8——FP8\",\"offset\":649},{\"match\":\"SMEM,\",\"offset\":827},{\"match\":\"SMEM,\",\"offset\":858},{\"match\":\"SMEM\",\"offset\":928},{\"match\":\"SMEM\",\"offset\":1049},{\"match\":\"自 SME\",\"offset\":1121},{\"match\":\". F\",\"offse