ry Wall (存储墙 _ Memory Bandwidth Bottleneck in GPU Computing)\",\"score\":588.1096652890503,\"foundWords\":[\"nvidia\",\"h100\",\"sm\",\"smem→dsm→smem\",\"smem→hbm→hbm→smem\",\"smem:\",\"smem\",\"tensor\",\"core\",\"fp8\",\"fp8/int4\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"NVIDIA\",\"offset\":241},{\"match\":\"H100\",\"offset\":248},{\"match\":\"H100\",\"offset\":666},{\"match\":\"SM\",\"offset\":722},{\"match\":\"SMEM:\",\"offset\":746},{\"match\":\"SM\",\"offset\":759},{\"match\":\"SM\",\"offset\":774},{\"match\":\"tensor\",\"offset\":924},{\"match\":\"SMEM→HBM→HBM→SMEM\",\"offset\":943},{\"match\":\"SMEM→DSM→SMEM\",\"offset\":967},{\"match\":\"SMEM\",\"offset\":1057},{\"match\":\"tensor\",\"offset\":1072},{\"match\":\"SM\",\"offset\":1087},{\"match\":\"H100\",\"offset\":1146},{\"match\":\"SM\",\"offset\":1242},{\"match\":\"SMEM\",\"offset\":1300},{\"match\":\"core\",\"offset\":1469},{\"match\":\"SM\",\"offset\":1487},{\"match\":\"FP8/INT4\",\"offset\":1620},{\"match\":\"SM\",\"offset\":1712},{\"match\":\"Core\",\"offset\":1852}],\"excerpt\":\"…compute throughput）增速远超内存带宽（memory bandwidth）增速的现象和由此产生的性能瓶颈。在 FlashFuser 的 quantitative evidence 中：NVIDIA H100 的 FP16 peak compute 从前代 A100 的 300 TFLOPS 增长到约 1000 TFLOPS（3.3×），而 HBM bandwidth 仅从 2 TB/s 增长到 3 TB/s（1.5×），增速差约 2.2×。这使得许多 deep learning workloads（特别是 GEMM-dominated 的 FFN 层和卷积块）从 compute-bound 变为 memory-bound——算子执行受制于 HBM bandwidth 而非 compute capability。Table I 显示在典型推理配置下（seq_len=512），…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Fused MoE（融合 MoE Kernel）.md\",\"basename\":\"Fused MoE（融合 MoE Kernel）\",\"score\":515.4539434942833,\"foundWords\":[\"nvidia\",\"h100\",\"sm\",\"sm100\",\"sm90/sm100。\",\"sm90\",\"sm90+\",\"sm。fusemoe\",\"tensor\",\"core\",\"fp8\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"tensor\",\"offset\":475},{\"match\":\"FP8\",\"offset\":824},{\"match\":\"H100\",\"offset\":852},{\"match\":\"H100\",\"offset\":2979},{\"match\":\"tensor\",\"offset\":3075},{\"match\":\"Core\",\"offset\":3428},{\"match\":\"NVIDIA\",\"offset\":34