":\"knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Marlin Kernel (NVFP4 Mixed-Precision Inference Kernel).md\",\"basename\":\"Marlin Kernel (NVFP4 Mixed-Precision Inference Kernel)\",\"score\":398.7117883736256,\"foundWords\":[\"nvidia\",\"h100\",\"h100/b100/rtx\",\"smem\",\"tensor\",\"core\",\"core（m16n8k32\",\"fp8\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"H100\",\"offset\":350},{\"match\":\"FP8\",\"offset\":478},{\"match\":\"Tensor\",\"offset\":527},{\"match\":\"Core\",\"offset\":534},{\"match\":\"_sme\",\"offset\":994},{\"match\":\"_sme\",\"offset\":1049},{\"match\":\"Tenso\",\"offset\":1313},{\"match\":\"Cor\",\"offset\":1320},{\"match\":\"NVIDI\",\"offset\":1644},{\"match\":\"H100/B100/RT\",\"offset\":1651},{\"match\":\"NVIDI\",\"offset\":2272},{\"match\":\"Tenso\",\"offset\":2294},{\"match\":\"Core（m16n8k3\",\"offset\":2301}],\"excerpt\":\"…Marlin kernel 适配到 NVFP4×BF16 操作——利用 Marlin 的 packed 4-bit weight layout 和高效 dequant+compute 融合策略，在 H100 GPU 上实现 NVFP4 量化模型的快速 rollout 推理。关键设计：(1) weight 以 packed 4-bit 格式存储在 GPU memory；(2) kernel 内部按 block 粒度 dequantize（NVFP4: FP8 block scale S_E4M3, block size=16）并立即执行 BF16 Tensor Core GEMM；(3) 避免先全部 dequantize 再 compute 的中间数据膨胀。Marlin 的 NVFP4 支持使 QeRL 的 rollout 加速 1.2−2.0× vs BF16，7B 模型仅占 5.9GB…\"}],\"totalCount\":10,\"truncated\":false},\"effectiveQuery\":\"path:knowledge_notes NVIDIA H100 SM Tensor Core FP8\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"6c5e516e-2581-4163-a224-dfd6ebbac74a","uuid":"e45945d1-6d73-47eb-a6d8-0f6fa75b7dbc","timestamp":"2026-05-31T10:26:12.594Z","tool_use_result":{"content":"{\"result\":{\"mode\":\"omnisearch\",\"hits\":[{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/FP8 Quantization for MoE Inference（MoE 推理的 FP8 量化）.md\",\"basename\":\"FP8 Quantization for MoE Inference（MoE 推理的 FP8 量化）\",\"score\":3511.604963289601,\"foundWords\":[\"nvidia\",\"h100\",\"sm90\",\"tensor\",\"tensorrt-llm\",\"tensorrt\",\"core\",\"core:\",\"core。\",\"fp8\",\"fp8_matmul\",\"fp8（8-bit\",\"fp8。gptq\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"FP8\",\"offset\":3},{\"matc