Accelerator (TMA / 张量内存加速器)\\n术语是什么？通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。\\nTensor Memory Accelerator (TMA) 是 NVIDIA Hopper (H100) GPU 架构引入的专用硬件拷贝引擎，用于在 global memory (HBM) 和 shared memory (SRAM) 之间进行高效的异步批量数据传输。TMA 支持 1D 到 5D tensor 的双向传输，核心特性包括：(1) 单线程发起——整个 warp 中只需一个线程发出 TMA transfer 指令，其余线程可继续计算；(2) 无寄存器…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/硬件知识笔记/WGMMA (Warpgroup Matrix Multiply-Accumulate) on Hopper GPU.md\",\"basename\":\"WGMMA (Warpgroup Matrix Multiply-Accumulate) on Hopper GPU\",\"score\":739.9630424511139,\"foundWords\":[\"nvidia\",\"h100\",\"h100,\",\"h100）；\",\"smem。\",\"smem,\",\"smem\",\"sm90\",\"tensor\",\"tensorized\",\"tensor-vector\",\"core\",\"fp8\",\"fp8——fp8\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"NVIDIA\",\"offset\":154},{\"match\":\"H100,\",\"offset\":172},{\"match\":\"SM90\",\"offset\":178},{\"match\":\"Tensor\",\"offset\":192},{\"match\":\"Core\",\"offset\":199},{\"match\":\"Tensor\",\"offset\":400},{\"match\":\"Core\",\"offset\":407},{\"match\":\"FP8\",\"offset\":520},{\"match\":\"FP8\",\"offset\":535},{\"match\":\"Tensor\",\"offset\":539},{\"match\":\"Core\",\"offset\":546},{\"match\":\"FP8\",\"offset\":583},{\"match\":\"H100）；\",\"offset\":609},{\"match\":\"FP8——FP8\",\"offset\":649},{\"match\":\"SMEM,\",\"offset\":827},{\"match\":\"SMEM,\",\"offset\":858},{\"match\":\"SMEM\",\"offset\":928},{\"match\":\"SMEM\",\"offset\":1049},{\"match\":\"自 SME\",\"offset\":1121},{\"match\":\". F\",\"offset\":1130},{\"match\":\"→ F\",\"offset\":1297},{\"match\":\"y Tensoriz\",\"offset\":1975},{\"match\":\"g Tensor-Vect\",\"offset\":2010}],\"excerpt\":\"WGMMA (Warpgroup Matrix Multiply-Accumulate) 是 NVIDIA Hopper 架构 (H100, SM90) 引入的新型异步 Tensor Core 指令。与 Ampere 的 wmma/mma 指令（每 warp 独立同步发射，发射后 stall 等结果）不同，WGMMA 将同一 CTA 内 4 个 warp 编组为 \\\"warpgroup\\\"（128 threads），单条 WGMMA 指令协作完成大规模矩阵乘法（如 m64n256k16 for FP16）。核心特性：(1) 异步执行——指令发射后立即返回（non-blocking），Tensor Core 在后台异步计算，warp 可继续发射后续指令；(2) 两种数据源模式——SS（A/B…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/mma.sp PTX Instruction (Sparse Matrix Multiply-Accumulate PTX 指令).md\",\"basename\":\"mma.sp PTX Instruction (Sparse Matrix Multiply-Accumulate PTX 指令)\",\"score\":699.7609427779491,\"foundWords\":[\"nvidia\",\"h100\",\"h100，使用\",\"smem_addr\",\"smem\",\"sm89\",\"sm80+\",\"sm80\",\"sm90\",\"tensor\",\"core\",\"core（sptc）的\",\"cores\",\"fp8\",\"fp8（hopper\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"NVIDIA\",\"offset\":88},{\"match\":\"Tensor\",\"offset\":116},{\"match\":\"Core（SpTC）的\",\"offset\":123},{\"match\":\"SM80\",\"offset\":201},{\"match\":\"SMEM\",\"offset\":696},{\"match\":\"smem_addr\",\"offset\":893},{\"match\":\"smem_addr\",\"offset\":1038},{\"match\":\"SMEM\",\"offset\":2179},{\"match\":\"SM80+\",\"offset\":2497},{\"match\":\"SM89\",\"offset\":2531},{\"match\":\"SM90\",\"offset\":2564},{\"match\":\"H100，使用\",\"offset\":2576},{\"match\":\"FP8（Hopper\",\"offset\":2709},{\"match\":\"FP8\",\"offset\":2734},{\"match\":\"Tensor\",\"offset\":3187},{\"match\":\"Cores\",\"offset\":3194}],\"excerpt\":\"`mma.sp` 是 NVIDIA PTX ISA 中用于调用 Sparse Tensor Core（SpTC）的 warp-level matrix multiply-accumulate 指令，从 PTX ISA 7.0（CUDA 11.0+，SM80 Ampere）开始可用。它允许程序员在 CUDA inline PTX assembly 中直接触发 SpTC 硬件执行 2:4 结构化稀疏矩阵乘法。与标准 `mma.sync` 指令的关键区别在于：(1) A 操作数必须是压缩稀疏格式（data+metadata pair）；(2) metadata 作为独立操作数传入，编码每 4 元素组中 non-zero…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/Memory Wall (存储墙 _ Memory Bandwidth Bottleneck in GPU Computing).md\",\"basename\":\"Memory Wall (存储墙 _ Memory Bandwidth Bottleneck in GPU Computing)\",\"score\":588.1096652890503,\"foundWords\":[\"nvidia\",\"h100\",\"sm\",\"smem→dsm→smem\",\"smem→hbm→hbm→smem\",\"smem:\",\"smem\",\"tensor\",\"core\",\"fp8\",\"fp8/int4\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"NVIDIA\",\"offset\":241},{\"match\":\"H100\",\"offset\":248},{\"match\":\"H100\",\"offset\":666},{\"match\":\"SM\",\"offset\":722},{\"match\":\"SMEM:\",\"offset\":746},{\"match\":\"SM\",\"offset\":759},{\"match\":\"SM\",\"offset\":774},{\"match\":\"tensor\",\"offset\":924},{\"match\":\"SMEM→HBM→HBM→SMEM\",\"offset\":943},{\"mat